# Field's presence is intentional, similar use by ~1,000 packages indicates
# evolving consensus that holds current guidance in abeyance.
built-using-field-on-arch-all-package *

# Upstream release tarballs and VCS tags are not cryptographically signed.
debian-watch-does-not-check-openpgp-signature *

# Field included on advice of DD Jonas Smedegaard; for more information, see
# <https://wiki.debian.org/Derivatives/Guidelines>.
unknown-field Original-Uploaders

# Package maintainer cannot control the contents of vendored libraries.
very-long-line-length-in-source-file *
